    &lt;body&gt;
        Dear Business,
        &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        The Replication of user &lt;B&gt;${property.SF_Empl_Email}&lt;/B&gt; for message "&lt;B&gt;${property.SAP_MessageProcessingLogID}&lt;/B&gt;" failed.
